## 2025-01-09 POST-REBOOT RESOLUTION

### System Recovery
ls -la /dev/ttyACM*
lsusb | grep -i monome
# Both grids connected, serialosc running after manual start

### Build Fix
# Fixed src/lib.rs - removed references to deleted grid.rs module
cargo run --example single_grid_test --features desktop
# Both grids detected but test reported false negative

### Final Test
cargo run --example debug_osc --features desktop
# Created examples/debug_osc.rs for isolated testing
# Result: Both grids working - user confirmed LEDs flashed on both m5032747 and m2949672
# All issues resolved - both grids functional via OSC

### Final Setup
# Created ai_instructions.txt with guidelines for future AI work on project

### serialosc Service Fix
# Fixed serialosc failing to start at boot due to DynamicUser permission issues
# Created user service instead: ~/.config/systemd/user/serialosc.service
systemctl --user enable serialosc
sudo loginctl enable-linger simonredfern
# Result: serialosc now starts automatically and both grids detected on ports 15335, 13832

